    <briefdescription>
<para>Container for a structure descriptors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Contains:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Atomic Energy Descriptors</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Force Descriptors (Optional)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Stress Descriptors (Optional)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>To fully initialise this object it needs to know:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>number of atoms in a structure (from <ref refid="structStructure" kindref="compound">Structure</ref>)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>number of nn for every atom (from <ref refid="structStructure" kindref="compound">Structure</ref>)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>dimension of the descriptor vector (<ref refid="classConfig" kindref="compound">Config</ref>)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>whether force and stress is being calculated (from <ref refid="classConfig" kindref="compound">Config</ref>)</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Required <ref refid="classConfig" kindref="compound">Config</ref> keys: <ref refid="classConfig_1FORCE" kindref="member">FORCE</ref> <ref refid="classConfig_1STRESS" kindref="member">STRESS</ref>. <ref refid="classConfig_1INTERNAL_KEY" kindref="member">INTERNAL_KEY</ref> <ref refid="classConfig_1DSIZE" kindref="member">DSIZE</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
